{"t": 1792853784236, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "b17", "Breaking a pot (B) took ~10 attempts (about 6 real minutes): B silently does nothing unless the crosshair is exactly on one of your pots from close range. The NEXT hint '4 m ahead' points at the bench but there is no 'press B' prompt or highlight when a pot is targetable, and near the bench the 'Step up to the wheel to throw a pot' line replaces the distance hint, which is misleading. Expected: a targeting highlight or 'B break <name>' prompt when a pot is in reach."]}
